OL,3,GNEWSAManchester Airport reviews parking
OL,4,Aafter complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking arrangements at Manchester
OL,7,FAirport are being reviewed after
OL,8,Fseveral taxi firms reported significant
OL,9,Froad traffic congestion in recent
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FThey have complained about standing
OL,13,Ftraffic on routes around Terminal 2,
OL,14,Fleading to significant delays in
OL,15,Fpicking up passengers.
OL,17,FAbu Bakar, from MCR Elite Transfers,
OL,18,Fsaid: "It's very frustrating for me
OL,19,Fbecause I am wasting time in traffic
OL,20,Fand it takes its toll on you because it
OL,21,Fmakes you tired."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
