OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAManchester Airport reviews parking
OL,4,Aafter complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester Airport said it was carrying
OL,7,Fout an "extensive review" and referred
OL,8,Fto "a range of factors including lower
OL,9,Fpassenger-to-vehicle ratios caused by
OL,10,Fgreater numbers of couples and solo
OL,11,Ftravellers arriving in cars compared to
OL,12,Fthe summer months".
